/P 438 0 R
/E (Answer: In order to renew your real estate license, all NYS Real Estate licensees are required to complete 22.5 hours of approved New York State continuing education before the expiration date which appears on your license. 11.5 of those hours are of required CORE topics. The remaining 11 hours may be taken in elective topics of your choosing.)
